1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Full synthetic costs more

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
at every oil change —

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,500
is it actually worth it?

4
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,000
It's not about price.

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,500
It's about what your engine

6
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:15,000
and your driving actually need.

7
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,500
Conventional oil breaks down faster under heat.

8
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:21,000
Synthetic holds up longer between changes.

9
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,500
Turbo engines, and short stop-and-go trips,

10
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:26,000
push oil harder — that's where synthetic can matter most.

11
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,000
The real answer's in your owner's manual —

12
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,000
not a guess at the counter. Nick's Tire & Auto.
